# AP2 - Button interrupt WITHOUT debounce (baseline)
# Date:      2026-11-05
# Firmware:  falling-edge IRQ on GPIO 15, flag + raw edge counter, no debounce
# Setup:     button GPIO 15 -> GND, internal pull-up; LED GPIO 14 via 330 R
# Procedure: 20 button presses, serial output via USB-CDC
# Expected:  press == 20
# Result:    FAIL - 24 counts for 20 presses (4 false counts)
# Note:      root cause found later with logic analyzer: contact bounce on
#            RELEASE produces extra falling edges (~0.42 ms burst, 3 edges).
# Note:      counter runs since reset; precondition "reset right before test"
#            was not strictly enforced in this run.

